second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the median age in Riceville?\", \"slot_hint\": \"age\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 39, \"text\": \"alone who was 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 40, \"end\": 113, \"text\": \"The average household size was 2.22 and the average family size was 2.84.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 114, \"end\": 156, \"text\": \"The median age in the city was 45.7 years.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 157, \"end\": 335, \"text\": \"21.9% of residents were under the age of 18; 7.3% were between the ages of 18 and 24; 19.3% were from 25 to 44; 25.8% were from 45 to 64; and 25.6% were 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 336, \"end\": 398, \"text\": \"The gender makeup of the city was 47.9% male and 52.1% female.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d00\", \"start\": 399, \"end\": 496, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, there were 840 people, 369 households, and 225 families residing in the\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 30, \"text\": \"average family size was 2.84 .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d01\", \"start\": 31, \"end\": 74, \"text\": \"The median age in the city was 45.7 years .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d01\", \"start\": 75, \"end\": 263, \"text\": \"21.9 % of residents were under the age of 18 ; 7.3 % were between the ages of 18 and 24 ; 19.3 % were from 25 to 44 ; 25.8 % were from 45 to 64 ; and 25.6 % were 65 years of age or older .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d01\", \"start\": 264, \"end\": 329, \"text\": \"The gender makeup of the city was 47.9 % male and 52.1 % female .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d01\", \"start\": 330, \"end\": 408, \"text\": \"2000 census [ edit ] As of the census [ 10 ] of 2000 , there were 840 people ,\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 29, \"text\": \"average family size was 2.84.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d02\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 72, \"text\": \"The median age in the city was 30.2 years.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d02\", \"start\": 73, \"end\": 260, \"text\": \"21.9 % of residents were under the age of 18 ; 7.3 % were between the ages of 18 and 24 ; 19.3 % were from 25 to 44 ; 25.8 % were from 45 to 64 ; and 25.6 % were 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d02\", \"start\": 261, \"end\": 325, \"text\": \"The gender makeup of the city was 47.9 % male and 52.1 % female.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d02\", \"start\": 326, \"end\": 402, \"text\": \"2000 census [ edit ] As of the census [ 10 ] of 2000, there were 840 people,\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 16, \"text\": \"of age or older.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0124-626372f7d859:d03\", \"start\": 17, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"The average household size was 2.83 and the average family size was 3.04.\"}, \"D4S3\":